    binding) solely to execute the transformation scripts locally without the
    SAP BTP Cloud Integration runtime.
  - Only the class/API name and method signatures are reproduced (as required
    for the scripts to compile); the implementation is entirely original Amazon
    work. No SAP-authored code or SAP libraries are included or redistributed.
  - The test harness depends only on Apache Groovy (Apache-2.0) and JUnit
    (EPL-2.0), retrieved from Maven Central at build time.
  - The offline test harness is for experimental/development use only, to
    validate transformation logic before deploying to a licensed SAP BTP Cloud
    Integration runtime. Users are expected to obtain a licensed SAP BTP Cloud
    Integration environment for production use.
